  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). A browser-only dashboard where a researcher loads participant-level JSON data with its JSON Schema, looks at each variable's distribution and missingness, compares groups, builds an AND/OR filtered cohort with a live attrition flow, and exports a Table 1 as CSV. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
